From cb0b26fb9dc5951ce5be1a905a17d6854912ac67 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 21:31:28 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add support for binned CCD frames (WIP, not fully
 validated)

Read CCDSUM and scale pixel-scale constants, resample the archival arc,
trace and wavelength references onto the binned grid, take read noise
from the header, and skip frames whose binning differs from the bias.
Output at 1x1 binning is identical to the original for the functions
tested. Binned 2x1 runs complete, but the wavelength solution and
combined spectrum are not yet verified.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015DV7mLbr7jEDcEFRzvjy3N
